        "title": "Pashupatinath Temple",
        "text": "This is an interesting place to visit.  Unless you are Hindu you are not allowed inside the temple but that does not detract from the overall experience.  You will get to experience a lot in a small area from the beggars and hawkers as soon as you enter to the architecture and destruction from the earthquake to viewing cremations on the river.  This is not for the weak and some people on our tour were disturbed from this experience, but that is why we travel to learn about other cultures and their way of life.  Be sure to have some small notes if you want to take a photo of the holy men, they will want money before you take the photo.",
