        "text": "Wow! I am tempted to describe this as mind bending, it is so far from my experiences.  We were lucky enough to visit the Temple on a holy day, which made it very busy but also added more atmosphere.  The holy men, the cremations, the animals in the river, people in their finest lining up to go into the temple, the women burning wicks, people handing our drinks and roasted barley and so much more - it threatened to overwhelm the senses.  One of the most amazing things I have ever seen.",
