        "title": "Get ready for some mixed emotions",
        "text": "You can walk just in front of the entrance of the tempel and take a peek inside. The only thing you will see is the big bump of Nandi the bull. Take some time to look at the people walking in and out the tempel. Walk aroud the main tempel towards the gaths, cross the bridge and get ready to see some live cremations. People are tollerant here. You can take pictures of the whole ceremony. But be awere! When they start the cremation the face of the deceiced is visible. Not for the faint hearted! Or children.",
